+#     regression this sweep exists for. Paragraph-scoping fails the same way, for the same reason.
+#   SENTENCE — a negator anywhere earlier in the sentence satisfied the test for a claim in a LATER
+#     clause, about a different subject. Demonstrated: "It does not merely make the fabrication
