+FAB = r"(?:fabricat\w*|invent\w*|forge[ds]?\b|fake[ds]?\b|bogus\b|made[ -]up|never\s+created)"
+# The OPERATIONAL half of the same claim, and the half 4105e9d actually regressed on: not "it detects
+# the fabrication" but "it resolves the reported sha and finds no object". Neither stem appears, so
