+# free-standing vocabularies dropped the sha out of these two arms entirely — only the `resolv` arms
+# still required one — and what was left matched the skill's REGISTER instead of its proposition. Four
+# true sentences on other subjects failed acceptance: "Triage rejects invented findings before the
+# count.", "The gate catches faked green runs.", "A reviewer that spots a fabricated gate result must
+# escalate rather than fix it.", "Identify made-up citations before you ship." The skill already writes
+# this way (build.md:155 "That fakes the signal"), and the FAIL each of them drew — "claims the
+# fabrication is detected" — was also a wrong diagnosis of the sentence it named. B9-B12 pin the
+# direction; the repo's own disqualifier is that a gate which fails on right writing is the same defect
+# as one that passes on wrong writing.
