+                #      any reviewer runs, a fabricated sha." both print ACCEPT, exit 0, zero FAIL.
+                #      Widening the window does not remove that residual, it moves it — every finite
+                #      window has a first sentence outside it. So the window is stated on the ok line
+                #      below rather than papered over: what this check reports is a claim in its
